  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/IMG_9535.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El caf&eacute;-rock La Oveja Negra, en la calle Mallorca, 25-esquina Sicilia de Onda, ha celebrado la noche-madrugada de este s&aacute;bado una concurrida fiesta de Halloween, con premios a los mejores disfraces masculino, femenino y de pareja, a quienes ha correspondio un jam&oacute;n, y el premio especial del gato negro, para la pareja de Pulp Fiction.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenovejanegra14/img_9470.jpg\" alt=\"img_9470\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenovejanegra14/img_9475.jpg\" alt=\"img_9475\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenovejanegra14/img_9477.jpg\" alt=\"img_9477\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenovejanegra14/img_9479.jpg\" alt=\"img_9479\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenovejanegra14/img_9481.jpg\" alt=\"img_9481\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenovejanegra14/img_9482.jpg\" alt=\"img_9482\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenovejanegra14/img_9483.jpg\" alt=\"img_9483\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenovejanegra14/img_9487.jpg\" alt=\"img_9487\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweenovejanegra14/img_9489.jpg\" alt=\"img_9489\" style=\"max-wid